    {
      "text": "Forest plot of TB-LAMP sensitivity and specificity with 95% confidence intervals against culture reference Standard 3 (Figure 5), with TP, FP, FN and TN counts for 13 studies, including India (RFA), Vietnam (RFA) and Ivory Coast (RFA). Sensitivity ranges widely from 0.48 (Vietnam RFA) to 1.00 (India RFA), while specificity stays between 0.90 and 1.00.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
